@* How a run that didn't finish ended, said first on its page (F126.3.4): a person's stop in the page's own colours,
   or the harness failing as the error it is, with the run's own reason; and how many conversations did not run. *@

@if (Run.Status == RunStatus.Stopped)
{
    <section class="card-p run-ending run-stopped-by-person">
        <h2>@StoppedTitle</h2>
        <p>@StoppedByAPerson</p>
        <p>@DidNotRun</p>
    </section>
}
else if (Run.Status == RunStatus.CouldNotFinish)
{
    <section class="card-p run-ending run-stopped">
        <h2>The run could not finish</h2>
        <p>@Run.StoppedBecause</p>
        <p>@DidNotRun</p>
    </section>
}
